#  - svg.c (the SVG image handler, NETSURF_USE_NSSVG -- the one this
#    build compiles; rsvg and nssprite are not built for the Vita, their
#    folds from 315 are compile-only here): (1) the redraw takes the
#    opacity byte into its path and text styles; (2) its path style was
