#    the vita path op reads opacity since 315 -- now zeroed; (3)
#    svg_reformat re-parsed into the SAME diagram and svgtiny_parse
#    APPENDS shapes, so an <img> laid out at a second size drew every
#    shape twice (2 PATHs; invisible solid, a wrong-alpha double blend
#    inside a group). It now parses into a fresh diagram on a size change
#    (keeping the old one if none can be created).
#  - image.c: image_bitmap_plot's 1x1 shortcut (a stretched 1x1 spacer
#    or colour image becomes a RECT) zeroes its stack style (recorded as
#    uninitialised at 315) and carries the opacity, so it fades too.
#  - plotters.h: BITMAPF_OPACITY_FIXED(b), the byte as a plot_style_fixed
#    for handlers that paint through style ops (0 stays 0 = solid; byte 1
#    stays above 0 so it still quantises to "skip").
#
